    "title":  "Chasing Echoes",
    "description":  "After Dexion\u0027s Elder Scroll reading reveals the need for two more Elder Scrolls, Serana suggests seeking her mother Valerica who may possess one. The search leads through Castle Volkihar\u0027s hidden passages, a moondial puzzle, and Valerica\u0027s laboratory where a portal to the Soul Cairn must be opened by recreating Valerica\u0027s experiment.",
    "npc_facts":  {
                      "Serana":  {
                                     "base_facts":  [
                                                        "I am a vampire and the daughter of Lord Harkon and Valerica.",
                                                        "My mother fled Castle Volkihar with an Elder Scroll to keep it from my father.",
                                                        "I know of a secret entrance to Castle Volkihar on the back side of the island.",
                                                        "I will not travel with you if you have another follower; they must be dismissed entirely."
                                                    ],
                                     "beat_facts":  {
                                                        "QUEST_START":  [
                                                                            "The Moth Priest\u0027s reading confirmed we need two more Elder Scrolls to unravel the Tyranny of the Sun prophecy. My mother may know where to find one."
                                                                        ],
                                                        "EXPLORE_COURTYARD":  [
                                                                                  "The moondial in the courtyard is missing its crests. My mother must have hidden something beneath it. We need to find the Half Moon Crest, Full Moon Crest, and Crescent Moon Crest."
                                                                              ],
                                                        "FIND_JOURNAL":  [
                                                                             "My mother\u0027s journal reveals she fled to the Soul Cairn, a plane of Oblivion. We must recreate her experiment to open a portal there."
                                                                         ],
                                                        "GATHER_INGREDIENTS":  [
                                                                                   "The portal requires Soul Gem Shards, Finely Ground Bone Meal, and Purified Void Salts placed in the vessel, then my blood to activate it. Regular bonemeal, soul gem fragments, and void salts will not work."
                                                                               ],
                                                        "SOUL_CAIRN_CHOICE":  [
                                                                                  "To enter the Soul Cairn you must be dead. I can turn you into a Vampire Lord, or partially soul trap you which will weaken you inside the Cairn."
                                                                              ],
                                                        "QUEST_COMPLETE":  [
                                                                               "We have entered the Soul Cairn. My mother Valerica must be somewhere in this place with the Elder Scroll."
                                                                           ]
                                                    }
                                 },
                      "Dexion Evicus":  {
                                            "base_facts":  [
                                                               "I am a Moth Priest who read the Elder Scroll.",
                                                               "My reading revealed a vision of Auriel\u0027s Bow but raised more questions than answers."
                                                           ],
                                            "beat_facts":  {
                                                               "QUEST_START":  [
                                                                                   "Two more Elder Scrolls are needed to fully unravel the Tyranny of the Sun prophecy."
                                                                               ]
                                                           }
                                        }
